WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.424
Kitewell is a fictional pediatric ABA clinic. This is the website a parent sees.

2
00:00:03.424 --> 00:00:09.267
It opens with the parent’s situation, not a sales pitch.

3
00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:14.685
Care, comfort and costs get their own plain-English pages.

4
00:00:14.685 --> 00:00:21.042
One switch shows the same page as the clinic team sees it.

5
00:00:21.042 --> 00:00:26.362
Numbered notes say what each section does for the family and for the clinic.

6
00:00:26.362 --> 00:00:33.487
The sample inquiry shows the queue item the clinic would receive.

7
00:00:33.487 --> 00:00:40.352
Four social profiles carry the same voice and link back to useful pages.

8
00:00:40.352 --> 00:00:48.818
In clinic view, every page ends with the offer.
